title    nothing good is fast
date     2026-07-29
tags     slowness rot
stage    seedling
---
Gardens do not have a load time. The interesting things here took years and
will keep taking them; a page that is *finished* is a page that is dead.

Optimising a website is a way of avoiding writing one. I have spent more hours
on the parser than on anything the parser parses, and I know exactly what that
means.

> Both of these are on the site at once, and both are mine. That is the point
> of [[contradictions]] — the disagreement is the record, not a bug to resolve.
